From: Goldzxcbug <Zxc20060226@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 22:19:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wayland: optimize dma-buf synchronization for Anland

Honor ANLAND_SKIP_IMPLICIT_SYNC_WAIT in the Wayland transaction path so Anland sessions can rely on EGL implicit synchronization without installing a duplicate per-buffer wait.

Also coalesce already-pending full damage from mailbox clients before propagating another repaint.

This backports upstream https://github.com/SuperTurtleDev/anland/commit/a6c4291dacdb8179130ea845a24ca39c5c210398

Co-authored-by: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
---
 src/scene/surfaceitem.cpp   | 7 +++++++
 src/wayland/transaction.cpp | 8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/scene/surfaceitem.cpp b/src/scene/surfaceitem.cpp
index 521766e..4559475 100644
--- a/src/scene/surfaceitem.cpp
+++ b/src/scene/surfaceitem.cpp
@@ -112,6 +112,13 @@ void SurfaceItem::addDamage(const QRegion &region)
         m_frameTimeEstimation = std::accumulate(m_lastDamageTimeDiffs.begin(), m_lastDamageTimeDiffs.end(), 0ns) / m_lastDamageTimeDiffs.size();
     }
     m_lastDamage = std::chrono::steady_clock::now();
+    // Mailbox clients commonly replace a fully damaged buffer repeatedly before
+    // the next composite. The latest buffer is installed through bufferChanged,
+    // so repeating damage propagation is redundant.
+    const bool damageAlreadyPending = !region.isEmpty() && m_damage.contains(region.boundingRect());
+    if (damageAlreadyPending) {
+        return;
+    }
     m_damage += region;
 
     const QRectF sourceBox = m_bufferToSurfaceTransform.map(m_bufferSourceBox, m_bufferSize);
diff --git a/src/wayland/transaction.cpp b/src/wayland/transaction.cpp
index fd53284..d0bd6eb 100644
--- a/src/wayland/transaction.cpp
+++ b/src/wayland/transaction.cpp
@@ -17,6 +17,14 @@ namespace KWin
 
 TransactionDmaBufLocker *TransactionDmaBufLocker::get(GraphicsBuffer *buffer)
 {
+    // The Anland backend composites client buffers through EGL, whose implicit
+    // synchronization waits before sampling the imported texture. Skip the
+    // duplicate per-buffer wait when explicitly requested for Anland sessions.
+    // Explicit sync timelines remain unaffected.
+    if (qEnvironmentVariableIntValue("ANLAND_SKIP_IMPLICIT_SYNC_WAIT") == 1) {
+        return nullptr;
+    }
+
     static QHash<GraphicsBuffer *, TransactionDmaBufLocker *> lockers;
     if (auto it = lockers.find(buffer); it != lockers.end()) {
         return *it;
